  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to Peace and Reconciliation in the Sahel and Southern Libya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support peace processes and conflict prevention initiatives at local, national, and international levels in the Central Sahel and Southern Libya through dialogue facilitation, mediation, empowerment of local actors, coordination support and analysis-sharing. Promediation supports a gender sensitive approach and strives to facilitate women&apos;s inclusion, inter alia through broader civil society and specific dialogue tracks, encouraging inclusion of female leaders and working closely with international and national partners, such as UN Women, to enhance inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
